**Validation Error Helpers** (`src/helpers/ValidationErrorHelpers.ts`):

- `TypedValidationError` - Custom error class for validation errors
- `formatValidationErrors()` - Formats express-validator results into GOV.UK-compliant error objects
- Error data structure interface with `summaryMessage`, `inlineMessage`, and optional `fieldPath`

